  "description": "Extinguish is a contemporary luxury serif family that combines timeless elegance with exceptional versatility. Featuring refined proportions, high-contrast strokes, and sculpted serifs, it includes 90 font styles, a Variable Font, professionally crafted ligatures, stylistic alternates, and Latin Pro language support.\nDesigned for branding, editorial, fashion, packaging, publishing, and premium visual identities, Mugnelis delivers sophisticated typography with outstanding flexibility, readability, and lasting visual impact.\nBuilt as a complete serif system, Extinguish gives designers the freedom to create everything from elegant editorial layouts to distinctive brand identities with a single, cohesive type family.",
  "fullDescription": "<p>Extinguish is a contemporary luxury serif family that combines timeless elegance with exceptional versatility. Featuring refined proportions, high-contrast strokes, and sculpted serifs, it includes 90 font styles, a Variable Font, professionally crafted ligatures, stylistic alternates, and Latin Pro language support.</p>\n<p>Designed for branding, editorial, fashion, packaging, publishing, and premium visual identities, Mugnelis delivers sophisticated typography with outstanding flexibility, readability, and lasting visual impact.</p>\n<p>Built as a complete serif system, Extinguish gives designers the freedom to create everything from elegant editorial layouts to distinctive brand identities with a single, cohesive type family.</p>",
